:: S: Shopping Day 1 [storylet] {"position":"4000,2175","size":"100,100"}
{=

(storylet: when
$place's sublocation is "The Grand Exchange"
)
(urgency: 1)
(metadata: "title", "See What's on Offer", "cardDesc", "Being the pumping heart of trade on this side of the Nurrah Sea, the markets of the Grand Exchange sees all kinds of goods flowing through its many chambers and floors.", "img", "https://fallenlondon.wiki/w/images/c/c8/Bazaar.png", "currency", "rial",)


$cssColumnParent[

$cssColumnChild[
	$cssBox[
    	($funcImage: (passage:)'s img)
         $cssBoxItem[''(print: (passage:)'s title )''<br>(print: (passage:)'s cardDesc)]
    ]
]

$cssColumnChild[

(either:
"The retail floors of the Grand Exchange is packed with people, as hot and humid as a steam bath. Grand Exchanges everywhere are alike - you almost miss home.",
"You make your way past the crowd, through a maze of stalls, almost tripped on a precious vase, only to be offered it right away. You push the smiling monger aside and go on your way.",
"It is so loud here. Haggling, boasting, arguing, laughing, all at once. Makes one forget what one is here for. Makes one more inclined to buy anything pushed one's way. ",
)
<br>
You keep your coins close. (either:
"Many are eager to take it, and not always politely.",
"They will serve you well.",
"Buy only what you need. No matter how good that pastry kiosk smells.",
)
<br>
$cssDesc[The Grand Exchange only accepts ''(print: (passage:)'s currency)'' - by order of the Ministry of Funds. But you can always sell your other currencies here, if you like being ripped off.
<br>
You currently have ($funcCheckExists: $char's player's inv, (passage:)'s currency, 0) (print: (passage:)'s currency).]
<br>
<br>
---
<ol>
You end up at...
<br>

<li>(link: "The dry food warehouse.")[(goto: "Shopping Day 1b")] $cssDesc[(To fill your belly during your travels.)]</li>

<li>(link: "The spices and reagents floor.")[(goto: "Shopping Day 1c")] $cssDesc[(And herbs, and extracts, and whatever else that goes in a cauldron in small quantities.)]</li>

<li>(link: "The apothecaries' floor.")[(goto: "Shopping Day 1d")] $cssDesc[(Tinctures, balms, and face powder, too!)]</li>

<li>(link: "The booksellers' floor.")[(goto: "Shopping Day 1e")] $cssDesc[(And scrolls, from all corners of Nurandah.)]</li>

<li>(link: "The currency swap office.")[(goto: "S: Currency Exchange (GE)")] $cssDesc[(Buy money itself... with other money.)]</li>

<li>(link: "Nowhere. There are better uses of your money.")[$funcBack]</li>

</ol>

